  "title": "Slow Cooker Buffalo Chicken Dip",
  "description": "This delicious Buffalo chicken dip is prepared solely in your slow cooker! Chicken breasts are cooked and shredded, then cooked with cheese, sour cream, and Buffalo wing hot sauce.",
